{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110187","id":3374027041,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7JG5Eh","number":110187,"title":"Web Export Crashes on iOS iPad 17.x","user":{"login":"JoelCreatesGames","id":62071362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMDcxMzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62071362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames","html_url":"https://github.com/JoelCreatesGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoelCreatesGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-02T00:43:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T01:14:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.3, 4.4, 4.4.1, 4.5.beta7\n\n### System information\n\nBroken: iPad 9th Generation, iPadOS 17.2 ~~  Fixed: iPadOS 18.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using html export on the previous major version of iOS, after some time the whole page will crash and reload; this happens with every browser. There are no console logs or noticeable spikes in cpu/memory\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25735704-26d0-48ed-9ca4-e3a2f36486bb\n\n<img width=\"1751\" height=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e47fcf9f-403b-4ecf-9a66-d78af66e9914\" />\n\nOn my primary project this happens in a matter of seconds. In this reproduction project it takes anywhere from 1-3 minutes to crash (and not consistent).\n\nUpdating to the latest 18.x iOS fixed this. I suspect this may be a OS issue, but wanted to report as I'm sure others will run into this too\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new project\n- Add audio and set it to loop (I suspect audio isn't needed, it just helps it happen sooner than an empty project), I used \"Cloud Dancer\" from [incompetech](https://incompetech.com/music/royalty-free/music.html) for something similar in length and size to my project\n- Create a basic scene\n- Export to web\n- Play on mobile safari 17.x (upload somewhere, mock local https, etc), and wait for the crash, a retry may be required. I suspect more complicated projects will happen sooner\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ios-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22085174/ios-bug-mrp.zip)\n\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"575\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5888caf5-fc31-4392-81cf-a4ffab97a286\" />","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110187/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}